\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7lNgyUaI\">当您订阅的投放账户下，存在项目修改记录时，会为您下发消息通知，通知范围：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-5LCOggSD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-N69k3AMa\">仅限「<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">巨量营销</span>」账户下的项目</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7ANEJRYQ\">您在<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">操作日志中可见的「修改」操作，均会下发消息通知</span>，包括：项目预算（预算类型/金额）、项目出价（深度出价）、投放结束时间、投放时段<strong>等</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tZ8huK53\"><strong></strong>注意：本事件<u>不包含项目状态变更</u>，状态变更请订阅另外一个事件status.project.realtime，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1722468664901647\">详见此文档【订阅服务类型】</a></li></ol></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-1JgZL0Lc\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-1JgZL0Lc\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/740fdc6ef25d4423b6b078a46cd120cf~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2072336781&amp;x-signature=a4Ozz2ykPzPXAORB2pNV%2B83rryo%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></h1><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-hWHdl9rQ\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-hWHdl9rQ\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-cd4EQ9jc\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-JPlipSPL\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-JPlipSPL\">关联API接口</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-mLqLIDD3\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/list/\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/list/</a></p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-3PGh5WJm\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-3PGh5WJm\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-0Z34UPSU\">POST</p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-FW0njrgB\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-FW0njrgB\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"header\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1722481732805646\"> 【X-Open-Signature签名校验】</a></section></section></section><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-SevhckMw\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-SevhckMw\">请求参数</h1><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-iLJKn7Q6\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-iLJKn7Q6\">基础信息</h2><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"request\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息ID,唯一标识</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅任务ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">service_label</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅服务类型,允许值:&nbsp;<p data-id=\"p838747a-UtNS7HuL\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-iavPM526\"><code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">settings.project.realtime</span></code>项目配置实时变更推送</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0aVYKb9S\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8AT4fhzm\">消息实际产生时间，秒级时间戳</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">timestamp</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-38o6raanb8c00\">毫秒时间戳，本条消息实际推送时间，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">nonce</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随机数，和timestamp组合防重放，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col co